    ` "по",
    `!"by",
    `""`$ posylalis  (посылались) is the plural form of the verb  poslat   (послать)  which translates directly to  to send  in `&  In the context of  posylalis   it implies that multiple items or messages are being sent at different times or from various places  For example  a sentence could be:  Posylalis piсьма по всему миру  (Letters were being sent all over the world) ",
