    `""`$ обращения  (obrashcheniya)`( appeals    petitions   or  requests   It is a plural noun derived from the verb  обращаться  (obrashchat sya)  which means  to appeal to someone    to address someone   or  to turn one s attention towards something   When used in different contexts  this word can also mean directions  instructions  or even a letter of complaint ",
