    ` "а",
    `!"and",
    `""`$ zарплата  (pronounced  zar-plah-tah )`( salary  in `&  It s important to note that the emphasis is on the first syllable and  depending on the context  it can be spelled with either a soft or hard sign above the  а   In this case   зарплата  has a hard sign (ж)  while  жарко  (hot) would have a soft sign (ж) ",
