    ` "англ",
    `!"handbook, english, guide, glossary",
    `#"0.0039484931",
    `""The Russian word \"англ\" is not typically used in modern Russian. It might have been used historically as a transliteration of the `& word \"angl.\" However, if you meant the `& word \"`&,\" it would be written as \"Английский\" in Russian."
  },
  {
    ` "как",
    `!"as, also, similarly, well",
    `""`$ как  (pronounced [kak]) is a versatile word that`( as    like   or  how  in `&  It can be used as a conjunction  an adverb  and an interjection depending on the context  In its basic form as a conjunction  it s often used to indicate manner  condition  or comparison in a sentence  For example   Я ежу как сыр  ( I eat like cheese ) compares the speaker s eating style to that of someone who eats slowly and enthusiastically  much like one might eat cheese  As an adverb  it can also mean  in what manner    how   or  as   The use of this word in various forms is quite extensive in Russian  making it an essential word for `& speakers studying the language to understand and master ",
    `#"0.0036696097"
  },
  {
