    ` "что",
    `!"that",
    `""`$ Что  (Pronounced as  Chto ) is translated to `& as  What   It is a pronoun  conjunction  and interjection used to ask questions about identity or inquiry  For example:  Что это?  means  What is this?  In a sentence  it can also function as a relative pronoun  similar to `& s  who  or  that   For instance   Это книга  которую я читаю  (This is the book I am reading) would translate to  This is the book that I read   It is an essential word in the Russian language for forming questions and expressing curiosity ",
