    ` "за",
    `!"for",
    `""`$ за  (pronounced as  za ) is a preposition and a conjunction that can be roughly translated to  for    because of   or  by   Its usage often depends on the context  For example   я пойду за маслом `( I m going for oil  or  I m going because I need oil   In other cases  it might mean  on behalf of  or  while/during   such as in the sentence  он работал за компанию  which`( he worked for a company   In longer sentences   за  may introduce clauses functioning as reasons or purposes ",
    `#"0.0024367522"
  },
  {
    ` "википедия",
    `!"wikipedia",
    `""`$ Википедия  (Vikipedia) is the equivalent of  Wikipedia  in `&  It refers to a multilingual  free  and open-source encyclopedia that can be edited by anyone  featuring content on almost every topic imaginable  Its mission is to provide a comprehensive and unbiased source of information for everyone  everywhere ",
    `#"0.0023707272"
