    ` "также",
    `!"also",
    `""`$ также  (takze) is equivalent to the `& word  also   It s used to add additional information or list items  indicating that something else should be considered along with what has already been mentioned  In formal writing  it is often translated as  as well   For example:  Я пишу эссе о книгах  также я буду рассказывать об авторах `( I am writing an essay about books  I will also tell you about the authors  ",
