    ` "его",
    `!"his, whose, the, and",
    `""`$ спринтерskim  doesn t have a direct translation in `& as it is derived from the term  sprint  (sprinter) but refers to something related to or resembling a sprint race  It could be used to describe a short  intense competition  event  or action  For example  you might say  его бег на спринтерском расстоянии  (his run on the sprint distance)  which`( his sprint run  ",
    `#"0.0020752049"
