  {
    ` "статья",
    `!"article",
    `""`$ статья  (statiya)`( article  in `&  It is commonly used to refer to a written piece or essay  especially one that is published in a newspaper or magazine  It can also be used more broadly to mean a provision or section within a legal document or code ",
    `#"0.0016470327"
