    `!"cm",
    `""`$ см  (pronounced as [sm]) is a contraction of the words  со мной  (meaning  with me )  It s often used in casual conversations  particularly in text messages or chats  to indicate that someone is joining you or going with you somewhere  For example  if someone says   Я иду в магазин  (I m going to the store)  another person might reply   См?  (Shall I come with you?) ",
