    ` "история",
    `!"history",
    `""История (Istoriya) is a Russian word that translates directly to  history   It generally refers to the study of past events  particularly in human societies  using various sources such as artifacts  documents  oral accounts  or other evidence  The term can also be used to describe a series of events themselves that have taken place in the past ",
