    `!"september, october, april, july",
    `#"0.001383029",
    `""Сентябрь in `& is September. This is a month of autumn (fall) and has 30 days in a common year or 31 days in a leap year. It's the ninth month of the year according to the modern-day Gregorian calendar, but it was originally the seventh month in the Roman calendar before January and February were added."
