    `""November in `& is \"November.\" It's the ninth month of the year and falls between October and December on the Gregorian calendar. In Russian, as you correctly stated, it's Ноябрь (pronounced as \"No-yabr'\" or sometimes \"Noyabr'\"). Practice saying it out loud to get a feel for the pronunciation! If you have more words you want help translating, just let me know. Good luck learning Russian!"
