  },
  {
    ` "победы",
    `!"victory, victories",
    `""`$ победы  (pobedy) is the plural form of  победа  (pobeda)  which`( victory  in `&  It s often used in reference to triumphs  accomplishments  or victories in various contexts such as war  sports  or any situation where one party emerges as the winner over another ",
