  },
  {
    ` "чт",
    `!"each",
    `""`$ чт  (pronounced as  chto ) is a form of the interrogative pronoun meaning  what  in `&  It s used to ask questions seeking information  similar to the `& words  What    That  or  Which   For example:\n\n- Russian:  Что ты делаешь?  (pronounced as  Chto ty delayesh? )`( What are you doing?  in `& \n- Russian:  Что это?  (pronounced as  Chto eto? )`( What is this?  in `& ",
