    `#"8.44045e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "вопрос",
    `!"question, issue",
    `""`$ вопрос  (vopros) can be translated as  question  or  inquiry  in `&  It s a common noun that is frequently used when asking someone something  seeking information  or discussing topics of debate  For example:  Я хочу позвать тебя на обед - это мой вопрос?  (I want to invite you for lunch - is this my question?)",
