    `!"he, on, his, stated",
    `#"8.38577e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"своём\"`(\"one's own\" or \"one's\" in `&. It is an adjective used to describe something that belongs to the speaker or someone else specifically. For example, \"моя книга своей мамой куплена\" means \"my book was bought by my mom.\""
  },
  {
    ` "земля",
