  {
    ` "ди",
    `!"da",
    `""`$ ди  (pronounced as  dyi ) is a preposition and a conjunction in the Russian language  As a preposition  it often indicates location or direction (e g    in    at   or  on )  When used as a conjunction  it connects two clauses expressing conditions or reasons  similar to `& s  if  or  because   The exact context determines its usage and translation into `&  For instance   я иду в магазин  потому что мне нужен ди масло `( I am going to the store because I need cooking oil   Here   ди  acts as a conjunction connecting two clauses: one stating the action (going to the store) and another explaining the reason for that action (needing cooking oil) ",
    `#"8.26208e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "образованиям",
    `!"give, me, why",
