    `#"8.23014e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "комплекс",
    `!"complex",
    `""`$ комплекс  (kompleks) can be translated as  complex  in `&  but it has a broader meaning that includes both psychological complexes and physical structures or systems  In psychology  it refers to a deeply ingrained set of feelings  thoughts  and behaviors related to certain topics  which are often rooted in past experiences  For example  a person might have a  mother complex  or an  inferiority complex   In other contexts  it can also mean a facility  building  or system ",
