    `""Зрение means \"vision\" in `&. It is a noun that refers to the ability to see or the faculty of sight. If you are learning Russian, it is helpful to know this word because it is commonly used in everyday language and medical contexts alike. For example, you could say \"У меня плохое зрение\" (I have poor vision) or \"Мне нужно новое очко для зрения\" (I need new glasses for my vision)."
