    `"" In Russian  the word  функции  (transliterated as  funktsii ) translates directly to  functions  in `&  It is a plural noun used to refer to mathematical or programming operations that perform a specific task when given certain inputs  For example  if a function calculates the square of a number  it takes one number as input and gives another number (the square of the original) as output  This term is commonly used in mathematics  computer science  and engineering to describe these types of operations ",
