  {
    ` "ми",
    `!"mh, tam",
    `""`$ ми  (pronounced as  mi ) is a preposition and conjunction  In its prepositional form  it`( in  or  into  when followed by a noun or a pronoun in the instrumental case  For example   Я входя в комнату  (Ya vkhodu v komnatu) means  I am entering the room  \n\nIn its conjunctional form   ми  connects two clauses that are usually subordinate and expresses a simultaneous action or cause-effect relationship  For instance   Я читаю книгу  потому что я в мире книг  (Ya chitu knigu  potomu chto ya v mire knig)`( I am reading a book because I am in the world of books   where the first clause (I am reading a book) is the main action and the second (I am in the world of books) explains why it s happening ",
