    `""`$ Васильевич  is a patronymic  which functions similarly to a middle name in some Western cultures  It indicates that the person s father was named Vasily (Василий)  In Russia  many people use their given name along with their patronymic as their last name in everyday life  especially when formal names are not used  For example  if a man named Ivan Vasilyevich is addressing another man named Petr Vasilyevich  he might refer to him as  Петр  (Petr) instead of using the more formal  Петр Иванович  (Petr Ivanovich) ",
