  {
    ` "протяжении",
    `!"continuously, longest, throughout",
    `""`$ протяжении  (pronounced as  prot yazheniye ) is translated to  extension    duration   or  length  in `&  It can be used in different contexts such as physical length  time duration  or even the scope or reach of something  For example  you could say  длина протяжении трубы  (dлина протяженiя tuby) which means  the length of the pipe   Or you could say  протяжённость поиска  (protyazhennost  poiska)  meaning  the extent or duration of search  ",
