    ` "казахстан",
    `!"kazakhstan",
    `""`$Казахстан (Kazakhstan) is the name of a country in Central Asia  named after the dominant ethnic group  the Kazakhs  It borders several countries including China  Kyrgyzstan  Uzbekistan  Turkmenistan  and others  It s known for its expansive landscapes that include central Asian desert steppes  the vast Caspian Sea  snow-capped mountains  and the Aral Sea (now largely dried up)  The capital is Nur-Sultan (formerly Astana) ",
