    ` "органы",
    `!"organs",
    `""`$ органы  (organy) can be translated as  organs  in `&  but it s important to note that its context can provide a more precise meaning  In a biological sense  organs refer to parts of an organism that perform specific functions necessary for life  However  outside of this context   органы  is often used figuratively in Russian to mean government institutions or law enforcement agencies  For example  you might hear someone say  Власть концентрируется в органах власти  (Vlast koncentriruetsya v organah vlasti)  which means  Power concentrates in the organs of power  ",
