  },
  {
    ` "феврале",
    `!"july, june, september, april",
    `""`$ Феврале  (Fevral ) is the genitive case of the month name  Февраль  (Fevral )  which`( February  in `&  So  when used in a sentence like  Вечер в феврале  (Vecher v februle)  it means  Evening in February   In Russian  each month has its own set of cases  and genitive case is used to express possession or belonging  as well as indicating the time of year ",
