    `!"su, ju, mig",
    `""`$ су  (pronounced as  su ) is a noun and verb in Russian  but it doesn t have a direct equivalent in `&  In its noun form   су  means a swamp or marsh  As a verb  it can mean to freeze  solidify  or be frozen  often used in the context of water (for example   сунуть воду  - to freeze the water)  It s important to note that Russian has many words with multiple forms and meanings  which can make learning the language challenging but also rewarding ",
