    ` "городах",
    `!"cities",
    `""`$ городах  (transliterated as  gorodah ) is the instrumental plural form of  город  (city)  So  if you re discussing multiple cities in a sentence  you might use this form  For example   В этих городах живут много людей  `( In these cities live many people   However  it is more common to see the nominative plural form of  города  (cities) used instead when referring to multiple cities without a preposition  such as  Многие люди живут в городах   ( Many people live in cities  )",
