    ` "какой",
    `!"whatever",
    `""`$ какой  (kakoy) is a masculine  neuter  and gender-neutral singular adjective that`( which    what kind of   or  what sort of   It s used to ask questions about the quality or type of something  For example  в каком доме проживает человек? (In what house does a person live?) or Какой автомобиль ты едешь? (What kind/type of car are you driving?) \n\nIt s essential to know that the declension of adjectives is an integral part of the Russian language  and  какой  changes its ending depending on the gender  number  and case of the noun it modifies  For instance  какой (masculine singular nominative)  какая (feminine singular nominative)  какое (neuter singular nominative)  каких (genitive plural)  etc ",
