    `!"soviet",
    `""`$ советские народные хозяйства  (sovetskiye narodnye hozyaystva)  often abbreviated as  Советнархоз  (Sovetnarhoz)  can be translated into `& as  Soviet People s Enterprise   In the Soviet Union  this term was used for large industrial and agricultural entities that were managed by local governments under the central planning system  These enterprises produced goods for the needs of society based on centralized directives  rather than responding to market demands ",
