    `!"lived",
    `""`$ жил  (zhil) can be translated as  lived  or  was living  in `&  It s a verb that is used to express the continuous past tense of living in a certain place  or it can indicate that someone was a resident or inhabitant at a specific location \n\nHere are some examples of how you might use  жил  in sentences:\n- Я жил в Москве 10 лет  (I lived in Moscow for 10 years )\n- Она жила в Санкт-Петербурге до 2015 года  (She lived in Saint Petersburg until 2015 )\n- Его предки жили на этой территории много веков назад  (His ancestors lived on this territory many centuries ago )",
