    `""`$ обе  (pronounced as  ob-ye ) is commonly used in two different contexts:\n\n1  As a numeral  it represents the number two when written or spelled out  such as in  две  (two) being pronounced as  dve   However   обе  is more often used in contracted forms  like  обед  (lunch)  derived from  обять  which means  take  or  get  \n\n2  As a conjunction  it roughly`( either   or   similar to the `& word  either   For example:  Я могу пойти либо быстро  или медленно   (I can go either fast or slow )",
