    `#"2.56474e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"классической\"`(\"classical\" in `&. It is an adjective used to describe something that belongs to a traditional or established style, especially one that is considered timeless and of high quality in the arts or literature. For example, you might refer to a \"классическая музыка\" (classical music) or a \"классическая литература\" (classic literature). Good luck with your Russian studies!"
  },
