    `!"afghanistan",
    `""`$ улучшите  (uluchshite) can be translated as  improve  or  make better  in `&  It is a verb that is used to express the idea of making something improve or become better in some way  often by adding new features or improving existing ones  This could be applied to objects  situations  or even ideas ",
