    `!"various",
    `""`$ различными  (razlichnymi) is a plural noun that`( different  or  various  in `&  It s typically used to describe multiple things that are distinct from each other or have diverse characteristics  For example   Этот кинотеатр показывает различные фильмы  (This cinema shows different movies) or  У меня есть различные цветок в саду  (I have various flowers in my garden)  It s an important word to learn for those interested in the Russian language  as it is commonly used in everyday conversations and written texts ",
