    `#"2.54528e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "франк",
    `!"franc",
    `""`$ франк  (frank) is a loanword from French and it`( franc  in `&  It specifically refers to the currency of France  Switzerland  Liechtenstein  and some other countries where the franc is used or has been used historically  For example  you might say  Я потерял франк  (I lost francs) if you ve misplaced some Swiss franc coins ",
