  {
    ` "марс",
    `!"mars",
    `""`$ марс  (Mars) is the name of the planet in the Solar System that is fourth from the Sun  It s the namesake of the Roman god of war  and its equivalent names in many languages are derived from this deity  In `&  Mars is commonly known as the  Red Planet  due to its reddish appearance caused by iron oxide (rust) on its surface ",
