    ` "органа",
    `!"organ, organs",
    `""`$ органа  (pronounced [ˈorɡənə]) is a feminine noun that generally`( organ  in `&  but its exact meaning depends on the context  In everyday usage  it can refer to musical instruments like the piano or organ  but when used in a biological sense  it means an internal body part such as an organ in the human body (heart  lung  etc )  When used in the context of administrative structures  it refers to government departments or agencies  So  the word  органа  can be quite versatile and its interpretation depends on the surrounding words and context ",
