    `""`$ автомобилей  (automobiley) is a plural form of the noun  автомобиль  (avtomobil )  which`( car  or  automobile  in `&  This term encompasses all types of motor vehicles designed for transportation on public roads  including cars  vans  and trucks  The plural form   автомобилей   simply means multiple cars ",
    `#"2.53648e-05"
  },
  {
