  },
  {
    ` "оформлении",
    `!"decoration, decorative",
    `""`$ оформлении  (oformlenie) can be translated as  arrangement    design   or  layout   It is commonly used in contexts such as decorating a room  designing a website  or filling out paperwork  In a broader sense  it can mean the process of making something ready for use with proper organization and presentation ",
