  {
    ` "раунд",
    `!"round",
    `""`$ раунд  (pronounced  raund ) is equivalent to the `& term  round   It s commonly used in sports or games context  indicating a single period of play  a match  or a series of competitions  For example  in tennis  one game consists of several points; these points are grouped together into sets  and each set is played as a best-of-three or best-of-five games  with the match itself consisting of three or five sets  In this context  the word  раунд  (round) can be used to describe one set within the match ",
    `#"2.52931e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "соборе",
