    `#"2.52767e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"собор\"`(\"cathedral\" in `&. It is typically used to refer to a large and important Orthodox Christian church building."
  },
  {
    ` "экспедиция",
    `!"expedition",
    `""`$ экспедиция  (ekspeditsiya) is translated as  expedition  in `&  It refers to a journey or mission  typically one organized by a government or scientific institution  made to explore a remote area or to conduct research  This term can also be used to describe an organized group of people who embark on such a journey together ",
    `#"2.52726e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "работали",
    `!"worked, employed",
    `""`$ работали  (pronounced  rabotal-i ) is the plural form of the verb  работать  ( rabotat  )  which means  to work   In the context of  работали   it indicates that multiple people have been working or they worked in the past  For example   Мы работали в театре `( We worked at the theater  ",
    `#"2.52603e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "считали",
    `!"believed",
