    `"" Сноски (plural)  or столбец сносок (singular) in Russian `( footnotes  or  endnotes  in `&  It refers to explanatory notes placed at the bottom of a page or at the end of a document  intended to provide additional information  clarify details  or cite sources ",
    `#"2.01468e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "детали",
    `!"details",
    `""`$ детали (details)  is used to refer to individual parts  components or aspects of something  It s commonly used when discussing a complex issue  object  or event and you want to focus on specific elements that make up the whole  For example  if you were explaining how a machine works  you might discuss its different details such as gears  bolts  or switches ",
