    `#"2.01182e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "национализм",
    `!"nationalism",
    `""Национализм (natsionalizm) in Russian is the term for  nationalism   This refers to the political ideology that identifies a nation with a particular territory and seeks to protect its culture  language  customs  and interests  It often involves promoting the interests of one s own nation over those of other nations or promoting the unification of a group of people who share common ancestry  history  culture  or language ",
    `#"2.01161e-05"
  },
  {
