    `!"personal",
    `#"2.0112e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"личный\"`(\"personal\" in `&. This word is used to describe something that belongs to an individual or something related to a person in a personal capacity, rather than official or shared with others."
  },
  {
    ` "краткий",
    `!"overview, brief",
    `"" In Russian   краткий  (kratkiy) is an adjective that`( brief    short   or  concise   It can be used to describe the length of time  space  or the content of a speech or document  For example  you might say  Краткая статья  (Kratkaya stat ya) meaning  short article  ",
    `#"2.01079e-05"
  },
  {
