    `!"bosnia, herzegovina, croatia",
    `#"1.99932e-05",
    `""Herzegovina in Russian is Герцеговина (Gertsiegovina). It's helpful to break down unfamiliar words into parts: Ger- (German) and -cegovina (region), indicating that the term refers to a region with German roots."
