    `""`$ продолжали  (pronounced: pro-dol-zhah-li)`( continued  or  were continuing  in `&  It is the third person plural form of the verb  продолжать  (pro-dol-zhah-t )  which means  to continue   This word helps to convey that an action has been ongoing or resumed after a break ",
    `#"1.99891e-05"
  },
  {
