    `#"1.99543e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "ядра",
    `!"nucleus, nuclei, kernel",
    `""`$ ядра  (yadra) can be translated into `& as  kernel    nucleus  or  core   It s most commonly used in scientific contexts  such as atoms  seeds  or computer programming  In the context of a computer  for example  it would refer to the essential part that contains the operating system and central processing unit ",
