    ` "реформа",
    `!"reform, reforms",
    `""`$ реформа  (reforma) is equivalent to the `& word  reform   It generally refers to a significant change or improvement made in a system  institution  or organization  For example  political reform  educational reform  and economic reform are all common phrases using this term ",
