    `""Сербии`(\"Serbia\" in `&. If you are learning Russian, I recommend practicing more with different words and phrases to improve your vocabulary and understanding of the language."
  },
  {
    ` "живопись",
    `!"painting",
    `""`$ живопись  (zhivopis ) is translated as  painting  in `&  It refers to the art or practice of creating visual representations on a surface by applying pigments suspended in a carrier substance such as oil  watercolor  or acrylic  In Russian   живописец  (zhivopiscez) is the term for a painter  and  картина  (kartina) means  painting  ",
    `#"1.98765e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "произошла",
    `!"occurred",
    `""`$ произошла  (pronounced as  proizoshla ) is the third-person singular feminine form of the verb  произойти  (to happen  to occur)  In a sentence  it can be used like this:  Это событие произошло вчера  which`( This event happened yesterday  ",
