  },
  {
    ` "высоко",
    `!"favorably, excellent",
    `""`$ высоко  (pronounced: vysokó) is an adverb meaning  high    tall  or  above   It can also be used as an adjective to describe something that is tall  lofty  or grand  For example   Эта башня очень высокая `( This tower is very high  ",
