  {
    ` "экс",
    `!"former, ex",
    `""`$ экс  (transliterated as  eks ) is commonly used in a few different contexts  and its meaning can depend on the context  Here are three common usages:\n\n1  In the context of academic degrees   экс  or  экзамен  means  exam   For example   я написал экзамен по математике  (ya napisal ekzamen po matematike)`( I wrote the math exam  \n\n2  In the context of the military   экспедиционный корпус  (ekspedytsionnyy korpus) means  expeditionary corps   referring to a military force deployed outside its home country  For example   Российский экспедиционный корпус был развернут в Сирии  (Rossiyskiy ekspeditsionnyy korpus byl razvernut v Sirii)`( The Russian Expeditionary Corps was deployed in Syria  \n\n3  In the context of chess   экс  (often used in algebraic notation) represents a check on the king  For example  if black plays Qh4# (Q - queen  h4 - the square on the board)  it means black s queen checks white s king and delivers mate ",
