  },
  {
    ` "ши",
    `!"ming, bao, wu",
    `""`$ ши  (Shi) is a preposition that can translate to either  sharp  or  as   depending on the context  For example   Ши по носу  means  as sharp as a nose  and  Ши кого-то делать `( to do something as someone else   It s important to note that Russian prepositions often have multiple meanings and can be used in various contexts ",
