  },
  {
    ` "общих",
    `!"main, distinct, grouped, basic",
    `""`$ общих  (obschikh) is a plural form of adjectives ending in  -ый/-ья/-е/-ье  and nouns ending in  -а/-я/-е  that are used to describe something common or shared by more than one person or group  In `&  it can be translated as  common  or  shared  depending on the context  For example  in the sentence  Это книги общих интересов  (This is a book of common interest)   общих  means  of common interest  ",
