    ` "косово",
    `!"kosovo",
    `""`$ Косово  (Kosovo) is a toponym that originates from Slavic languages  It refers to a region in Southeastern Europe  primarily recognized as the republic of Kosovo today  This region has historical and political significance  as it was part of various empires such as the Roman  Byzantine  and Ottoman Empires before becoming part of Serbia in the late 19th century  The conflict over Kosovo s independence from Serbia in the 1990s gained international attention ",
