  {
    ` "передан",
    `!"transferred",
    `""`$ передан  (peredan) can be translated as  delivered    transferred   or  handed over   It is a verb  and in different contexts it could mean to give something to someone  to pass something on  or to submit something for consideration  For example  if you ve just finished reading a book and passed it on to your friend  you might say that you передали (peredalili) книгу (knigu - book)  If a company is acquired  the ownership can be described as being передан (peredan) to the new owner ",
