    `""`$ трудно  (trudno) is an adverb that`( difficult  or  hard  in `&  It s important to note that  depending on the context  it can be used as both an attribute and a predicate in sentences  For example:\n\n- Predicate: Это трудно (Eto trudno) - This is hard/difficult \n- Attribute: Эта задача трудна (Eta zadacha trudna) - This task is difficult ",
