    `!"cars",
    `""`$ автомобили  (transliterated as avtomobili) is the plural form of  автомобиль  (avtomobil)  which means  car  or  automobile  in `&  So   автомобили  refers to multiple cars ",
    `#"1.83509e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "горных",
    `!"mountain, mountains",
    `""`$ горных  (pronounced: gor nyh) is a plural form of the masculine noun  горный  (gor nyj)  which translates directly to  mountainous   However  in `&  we usually say  mountain range  or  mountains   so a more accurate translation for  горных  could be  mountain ranges  or  mountains  when referring to multiple mountainous regions  This term is often used in geographical contexts ",
