    ` "жанра",
    `!"genre",
    `""`$ жанра  (pronounced [zhɑn ra])`( genre  in `&  It refers to a category of artistic composition  as found in literature  music  visual arts  film  and other cultural expressions  This term helps us group works based on their common features  themes  or technical elements  For example  a novel about space exploration might fall under the genre of  science fiction  ",
    `#"1.83509e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "возникновение",
