  },
  {
    ` "приходилось",
    `!"tended, difficult",
    `""`$ приходилось  (prihodilos ) is a past participle and could be translated as  had to    was necessary to  or  it was required that  in `&  depending on the context  It s typically used to express that something happened due to circumstances rather than personal choice  For example   Я приходилось бегать в дождь  (Ya prihodilos  begat v dozhdy) can be translated as  I had to run in the rain  ",
