  },
  {
    ` "способы",
    `!"methods",
    `""`$ способы  (pronounced: sposoby) is the plural form of  способ  (pronounced: sposob)  which`( methods    ways   or  means   So   способы  would mean  methods    ways   or  means  in `& as well  In a sentence  for example  you could say   Мои способы решения задачи - читать книги и изучать примеры  (My methods of solving the problem are to read books and study examples) ",
