  },
  {
    ` "провели",
    `!"conducted",
    `""`$ провели  (pronounced  pro-ve-li ) is a verb in the past tense  meaning  to lead    to conduct   or  to spend time   It s often used to indicate that something was done or organized  as in the phrase  мы провели встречу  ( we conducted/held a meeting )  In the context of spending time  it could be translated as  we spent time   as in  мы провели вечер в кино  ( we spent the evening at the movies ) ",
    `#"1.83119e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "пушки",
    `!"guns",
    `""`$ Пушки  (Puški) is a diminutive form of  пушка  (puška)  which`( cannon  in `&  The diminutive form  as in  Пушки   is more affectionate or informal and can sometimes be used to indicate multiple cannons ",
    `#"1.83119e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "желание",
    `!"desire",
