  },
  {
    ` "сыграла",
    `!"role, starred, played",
    `""`$ Сыграла  (Sigrala) is a feminine form of the verb  Играть  (Igrat )  which`( to play  in `&  When you add  -ла  at the end  it becomes the past tense of the verb for a female subject  So   Сыграла  means  She played   For example  in a sentence:  Она сыграла на пианино `( She played the piano  ",
