  },
  {
    ` "подразделение",
    `!"division, unit",
    `""`$ подразделение  (pronounced podrazdelenie) can be translated as  unit  or  subdivision   It is commonly used to refer to a smaller military or organizational division within a larger entity  such as a company or army  However  it can also be applied more broadly to any division  department  or group within an organization ",
