    `#"1.81829e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "ленинградской",
    `!"leningrad",
    `""`$ ленинградской  (transliterated as  Leningradskoy ) is a feminine adjective that refers to something associated with Leningrad  which was the name of St  Petersburg during the Soviet era from 1924 to 1991  when it was named after Vladimir Lenin  Nowadays  it s called Saint Petersburg again  So  ленинградской  can be used in `& contexts to describe something that is related to or originates from St  Petersburg  For example   ленинградская кухня  (Leningrad cuisine) or  ленинградский матьек  (a traditional confectionery from Leningrad) ",
    `#"1.81809e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "отказаться",
    `!"cancel, accept, abandon",
    `""`$ отказаться  (otkazatsya) is a verb  and it`( to refuse  or  to reject  in `&  This word is used when someone decides not to do something that was asked of them  or when they decline an offer  For example  if John doesn t want to attend the party  he can say   Я откажусь  (Ya otkazus ) which means   I will refuse  ",
    `#"1.81809e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "завершения",
    `!"completion",
    `#"1.81768e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"завершения\"`(\"completion\" or \"conclusion\" in `&. When learning Russian, try to remember that 'за-' usually means 'at', 'to', or 'in'; 'верш' is the stem of the verb 'вершить' which can mean 'to finish' or 'to complete'. So, by putting them together, you get a word that refers to the act or result of finishing something."
  },
  {
    ` "промышленных",
    `!"industrial",
    `""`$ промышленных  (pronyshlennyh) is a plural form of the adjective  промышленный  (pronyshlennyy)  which`( industrial  in `&  It s used to describe objects  places  or processes related to manufacturing  industry  or technology  For example   промышленных объектов  means industrial sites or facilities ",
    `#"1.81727e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "популярных",
    `!"popular",
    `""`$ популярных  (popularnyh) is a plural form of the adjective  популярный  (popularny)  which translates directly to  popular  in `&  So   популярных  means  popular things   or  popular people   For example   Они смотрят популярные фильмы  (They are watching popular movies) ",
    `#"1.81686e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "альянс",
    `!"alliance",
