  },
  {
    ` "партией",
    `!"party",
    `#"1.81543e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"партией\"`(\"party (political party)\" in `&. It is commonly used to refer to a political party or faction in a political context. For example, \"Я участвую в партии\" means \"I am a member of the party.\""
  },
  {
    ` "кристина",
    `!"christina, kristina",
