  },
  {
    ` "охране",
    `!"protection, conservation",
    `#"1.8144e-05",
    `""In `&, the Russian word \"охране\"`(\"protection\" or \"guarding\". It's commonly used in phrases such as \"охрана здания\" (building protection) or \"охрана порядка\" (order maintenance). Learning how to correctly use context clues when encountering new words can be very helpful for those just starting out learning a new language. Good luck with your studies!"
  },
  {
    ` "прошлого",
    `!"past",
    `""`$ прошлого  (pronounced  proshl-og ) is a masculine singular noun that`( of the past  or  last year s  in `&  It is often used as a part of phrases  such as  из прошлого года  ( iz proshlago goda )  which means  from last year   Understanding this word can help you communicate more effectively when discussing events that occurred in previous years ",
    `#"1.8142e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "ядро",
    `!"core, nucleus, kernel",
