  },
  {
    ` "аниме",
    `!"anime",
    `""`$ аниме  (pronounced [anˈime]) is a loanword that comes from Japanese and is used to refer to animated films or television series originating in Japan  specifically those with unique visual styles and techniques  It s often associated with genres like fantasy  science fiction  romance  action  and more ",
    `#"1.81194e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "напряжения",
    `!"voltage",
    `""`$ напряжения  (napryazheniya) is a plural noun that`( tensions  or  pressure  in `&  It can be used to refer to emotional  physical  or situational stress or strain  For example  you might say  Напряжение между странами рос  (The tension between countries is growing)  or  Я испытываю напряжение от работы  (I m feeling the pressure from work) ",
