  },
  {
    ` "оборот",
    `!"bayer, eur, euro, around",
    `""`$ оборот  (oborot) can be translated to  turn    circumstance   or  sentence construction   When used in the context of a sentence  it often refers to a turn of events  a situation  or a way of expressing something in language  It s quite versatile and can help you understand various aspects of Russian culture and literature ",
    `#"1.81154e-05"
  },
  {
