    ` "рассказал",
    `!"told",
    `""`$ рассказал  (pronounced as  rasskazal ) is the past tense of the verb  рассказывать  (pronounced as  rasskazhat )  It means  he told a story  or  he recounted   In `&  it can be translated to simple tenses like  told    narrated   or  recounted   However  the nuance may vary depending on the context  For example  if  он рассказал мне историю  (pronounced as  on rasskazal menia istoriyu ) is translated to `&  it would be  he told me a story  or  he narrated a story to me  ",
    `#"1.78696e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "мали",
    `!"mali",
    `""`$ мали  (pronounced as  mal-ee ) is a diminutive form of the noun  малое  (pronounced as  mah-loy-eh )  which means  small  or  little   In this diminutive form  it is often used in casual  affectionate or playful speech  For example  instead of saying  малое колесо  (a small wheel)  you might say  малишко колесик  to imply something small and possibly endearing like a toy wheel ",
