    `""`$ рей  (pronounced as  rey ) is a noun that can have multiple meanings depending on the context  In aviation  it refers to a flight or an air route  However  in a more general sense  particularly when used in the plural form  реи  (rei)  it denotes a series of events  a sequence  or a set of problems or tasks  This usage is quite common in expressions like  рей событий  (rei sobytii) which`( a series of events  ",
