  {
    ` "окончание",
    `!"ending",
    `""Окончание (okonchanie) in Russian is a grammatical term that refers to the ending or suffix of a word  especially in declensions and conjugations  It helps determine the case  gender  number  tense  and aspect of a word  For example  the masculine singular nominative form of  город  (city) is  город   but its genitive singular form is  города  (of the city)  and that change comes from the genitive ending -а/-о at the end of the base form ",
    `#"1.72757e-05"
  },
  {
