    `!"widely",
    `""`$ многими  (mnogimi) is a plural form of the adjective  много  (mnogo)  which means  many  or  a lot   So   многими  can be translated to  by many  or  in a large number of ways  in `&  It s important to note that the grammatical case and gender of  многими  depend on the noun it is describing  For example  if used with a masculine noun  you would say  многими людьми  (mnogimi lyudyami)  which`( by many people  ",
