    `#"1.35609e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"Карло\"`(\"Charles\" in `&. It is a name of male origin and is derived from the Germanic Karl, which means \"man\" or \"free man\". In Russian, it can also be transliterated as Karp, Karol', or Karlik depending on context and usage."
  },
  {
