  },
  {
    ` "индустрии",
    `!"industry",
    `""`$ индустрии  (industrii) is the plural of  индустрия  (industriya)  which`( industry  in `&  It refers to a broad field or sector of the economy that produces goods or provides services  such as automotive industry  textile industry  etc ",
