    `#"1.35527e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "репрессии",
    `!"repression",
    `"" The Russian term  репрессии  (repressii)`( repressions  or  persecution  in `&  In a historical context  it often refers to large-scale political oppression and suppression of dissent  particularly associated with the Soviet Union under Stalin s rule  It encompasses arrests  exile  forced labor  concentration camps  and executions  among other forms of punishment and control ",
    `#"1.35486e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "головного",
    `!"nervous, brain",
