    `#"1.35466e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "элемента",
    `!"element",
    `#"1.35466e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"элемента\"`(\"element\" in `&. This term is commonly used in science and refers to a basic form or substance that cannot be further divided into simpler substances by chemical means. For example, hydrogen and oxygen are elements because they cannot be broken down any further through chemical reactions."
