  },
  {
    ` "византийский",
    `!"byzantine",
    `"" The Russian term  Византийский  (Vizantiyskiy)`( Byzantine  in `&  It refers to the Byzantine Empire  which was a continuation of the Roman Empire in its eastern provinces during Late Antiquity and the Middle Ages  This empire centered on Constantinople and is notable for its cultural  political  and architectural influences that have shaped the world as we know it today ",
    `#"1.35343e-05"
