    ` "ривер",
    `!"river",
    `#"1.35179e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"Ривер\"`(\"River\" in `&. This is a basic example of how to translate common words between these two languages. As you continue learning Russian, you will encounter more complex grammar and vocabulary! Keep practicing and don't forget to have fun along the way! If you have any more questions, feel free to ask!"
  },
  {
