  },
  {
    ` "возможностей",
    `!"opportunities, possibilities, capabilities",
    `""`$ возможностей  (vozmozhnostey)`( possibilities  or  opportunities  in `&  It is a plural noun  so it refers to more than one possibility or opportunity ",
