    `#"1.34913e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"астрель\"`(\"starfish\" in `&. It's a term used for marine animals resembling the shape of a star or starfish."
  },
  {
    ` "буркина",
    `!"cameroon, burundi, gabon, burkina",
