    ` "старт",
    `!"launch, race",
    `""`$ старт  (start) is a noun that is commonly used in various contexts such as starting a car  beginning a race  or initiating an action  In plural form  it can also mean the start or launch of something  like the start of a project or a business  It s essential to note that Russian has different cases  so the ending of the word can change depending on its function in a sentence (nominative: старт; genitive: старта; dative: старту; accusative: старт; instrumental: стартом; prepositional: на старте)  To fully grasp its usage  it s crucial to understand Russian grammar and context ",
