    `""`$ располагались  (pronounced: RA-spoh-lah-glihs) is in the past tense  plural form of the verb  распологаться  (RA-spoh-luh-guh-tsey)  which`( to arrange oneself  or  to position oneself  in `&  So  when you see  располагались   it means that multiple people arranged themselves or positioned themselves in a certain way  For example   Они располагались рядом с окном   (They arranged themselves next to the window )",
