    ` "вызвать",
    `!"cause",
    `""`$ вызвать  (vyzvat ) can be translated as  to call  or  to summon   However  it can also mean to invite  ask  or request someone in a more formal sense  It s important to note that this verb has two forms:  позвонить  (pozvonit   dial) is usually used when referring to making a phone call  while  вызвать  is used for other types of calls  like summoning or inviting someone in person ",
