  {
    ` "высшим",
    `!"highest",
    `#"1.19185e-05",
    `""In `&, \"высший\" can be translated as \"highest\" or \"supreme\". This adjective is used to describe something that ranks at the top or highest level in terms of quality, importance, or rank. For example, \"Высшая школа экономики\" (The Higher School of Economics) or \"Высший совет по национальной безопасности\" (Supreme Security Council)."
