  },
  {
    ` "лесу",
    `!"woods, forest",
    `""`$ лесу  (pronounced as  lesu ) is a noun in the singular  nominative case  It refers to  forest  or  woods   In other cases and forms  it could be translated as:\n\n- Accusative: лес (les)\n- Genitive: леса (lesa)\n- Dative: лесу (lesu) (same as nominative in this case)\n- Instrumental: в лесу (v lesu) -  in the forest  or  in the woods \n- Prepositional: на лесу (na lesu) -  on the forest  or  on the woods \n\nIn `&  it s essential to remember that  the forest  is translated as  лес  in Russian  while  woods  could be translated as  луг  (lug)  but can also be  лес  depending on the context ",
    `#"1.19021e-05"
  },
  {
