    `#"1.18858e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "коммунизм",
    `!"communism, socialism",
    `""`$ коммунизм  (kommunizm) is translated as  communism   It refers to a political and economic ideology that aims to create a classless  stateless society where all property and means of production are owned collectively by the community  This system is based on the sharing of resources  equal distribution of goods and services  and the absence of private property  The term was popularized by Karl Marx and Friedrich Engels in their work  The Communist Manifesto   In Russia  it was implemented from 1917 to 1991 under the Soviet Union led by Vladimir Lenin and Joseph Stalin ",
    `#"1.18837e-05"
  },
  {
