    `#"1.18653e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"силе\"`(`& as \"force\" or \"power\". It is a noun and can be both singular (сила) or plural (силы). This term can refer to physical force or power in general, but can also have other meanings depending on the context. For example, in the phrase \"он действует под сильным влиянием\" (\"he is acting under strong influence\"), \"силе\" refers to a more metaphorical or psychological force."
