    `#"1.13206e-05",
    `""The Russian word Бруней`(Brunei in `&. It is the name of a small Southeast Asian nation on the island of Borneo. This country is officially known as Negara Brunei Darussalam, which means \"Abode of Peaceful and Prosperous Brunei\" in Malay. Learning the names of countries can help you build your vocabulary in Russian and become more familiar with different cultures around the world."
