    ` "прекратил",
    `!"ceased",
    `""`$ прекратил  (prekratil) is the Past Tense of the verb  прекращать  (prekraschat  - to stop  to cease)  So   прекратил  means  he stopped   or more generally   he ceased   It s important to note that Russian verbs can change depending on who is performing the action (subject)  and the ending of the verb can vary based on gender and number  For example  for a male subject in the singular  the correct form would be  он прекратил  (on prekratil) ",
