    `!"history",
    `""`$ историей  (istoriya) is the noun form of the adjective  исторический  (istorichesky)  which`( historic  or  pertaining to history   In a broader context   история  refers to history  whether it be a specific event  a period of time  or the overall study and academic field of history  For example:\n\n1  Истories (the plural of история) - Histories\n2  Она изучает истoriю (Ona izuchaet istoriyu) - She is studying history \n3  Эта страница описывает значительные события мировой истoriи (Eta stranitsa opisyvaet znachitel nye sobytiya mirovoy istorii) - This page describes significant events in world history \n\nNote that the Russian plural form for  история  is not always regular: it does not change when you add an  s  at the end  like in `& (histories instead of history)  However  if you want to express a countable noun with the meaning of stories or historical accounts  you can use another Russian word -  рассказы  (raskazy)  which is the plural form of  ра",
