    `""`$ дан  (transliterated as  dan ) can have several meanings depending on the context  It is an adjective and a noun in the Russian language  and it can be translated to `& as:\n\n1  Given: As in something that has been given or provided  Example: Я получил данные (I received data) \n2  Given name: As in someone s first name  For example: Иван Даньшин (Ivan Danishin) \n3  Data: In the context of information technology   дан  can refer to data or facts used for statistical analysis  Example: Это большое количество данных (This is a large amount of data) ",
