    ` "чи",
    `!"chi, cho, ho, ko",
    `""`$ чи  (chyi) is a pronoun that functions as a question word  similar to  who  or  which  in `&  It is used to ask questions about people or things  For example:\n\n*  Кто пришел?  (Kto prišel?) means  Who came? \n*  Что это за книга?  (Čto eto za kniga?) means  What kind of book is this? \n\nIt can also be used as an interrogative adverb  meaning  where   such as in the sentence:  Где мы идём?  (Gde my idem?) which`( Where are we going? \n\nIn written Russian  the  y  sound is represented by the letter  и  and the  i  sound is represented by the letter  й   so you may also see this word written as  чи  or  чий  ",
