    `#"1.02946e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "кавказской",
    `!"caucasian, caucasus",
    `""`$ Кавказской  (Kavkazskoy) refers to something related to or originating from the Caucasus  a region located at the border of Europe and Asia  In a geographical sense  it encompasses much of Southern Russia and several neighboring countries including Armenia  Azerbaijan  and Georgia  It is also used more broadly to refer to people  cultures  or issues associated with this diverse and historically significant region ",
