    `#"1.02884e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "пещера",
    `!"cave",
    `""`$ пещера  (pronounced as  peshchera )`( cave  in `&  It is commonly used to refer to a natural hollow place in the ground of a fairly large size  created either by solution or erosion  This term can also be applied metaphorically in certain contexts ",
    `#"1.02884e-05"
  },
  {
    ` "произведено",
    `!"carried",
    `""`$ произведено  (pronounced as  proiz-vedeno ) is a past participle of the verb  производить  (to produce  manufacture  or create)  in its passive voice  So  when you translate it to `&  it becomes something like  has been produced    was made   or  has been created   For example   Этот телевизор был произведен в 2019 году  (This TV was made in 2019) ",
    `#"1.02884e-05"
  },
