  },
  {
    ` "прокурора",
    `!"prosecutor",
    `#"1.02864e-05",
    `""The Russian word \"прокурора\"`(\"prosecutor\" in `&. This is a professional title referring to someone who represents the state in legal matters, particularly in criminal cases. They are responsible for investigating crimes, preparing and presenting evidence in court, and enforcing laws on behalf of the government."
  },
