    `""`$ заключении  (pronounced zad-kyoochehnee-jee) can be translated to `& as  conclusion  or  imprisonment   In its broader context  it refers to a conclusion or end  but in legal terms  specifically  it means imprisonment  For example  a person might be sentenced to jail in  заключении  after being found guilty of a crime ",
