  {
    ` "пение",
    `!"singing",
    `""`$ пение  (peñie) translates directly to  singing   It is a noun  and it refers to the act of singing or the sound produced when someone sings  So if someone says they enjoy  пение  in Russian  it means that they enjoy singing or listening to singing ",
