  {
    ` "чёрном",
    `!"black",
    `#"9.9587e-06",
    `""The Russian word \"чёрным\"`(\"black\" in `&. When learning Russian, it's helpful to memorize key words and their definitions as well as understanding the grammar rules and pronunciation guides. For example, в ночи (at night) is composed of two parts: в (in/at) and ночь (night). You can use this structure when learning other prepositions like on (на), from (от), with (с), and so forth. Good luck in your language-learning journey!"
  },
