    `#"9.9526e-06",
    `""The Russian word ХК`(\"HC\" in `&. This abbreviation is commonly used in sports and refers to Hokkey (Hockey) Klub (Club). For example, СКА (SKA) in Saint Petersburg or Ак Барс (AK Bars) in Kazan are both professional hockey clubs."
