    `!"washington",
    `#"9.9505e-06",
    `""The Russian word Вашингтоне (Washington)`(\"Washington\" in `&. This is a common name for cities or regions named after George Washington, the first President of the United States. For example, Вашингтон (Washington, D.C.) and Вашингтонский штат (Washington State)."
