  {
    ` "конструкций",
    `!"constructions",
    `#"9.9423e-06",
    `""The Russian word \"конструкций\"`(\"constructions\" in `&. It's a plural noun derived from the adjective \"конструктивный\" or \"constructive\". If you are learning Russian and come across this term, remember that the 'и' ending indicates the plural form."
  },
  {
    ` "прайм",
