    `""In `&, the Russian word \"отличаться\"`(\"to differ\" or \"to be different\". This verb is used when describing how two things are not the same, or when one thing stands out from another. For example, \"Этот дом отличается от других домов по своему дизайну.\" means \"This house differs from others by its design.\""
