  {
    ` "британия",
    `!"britain",
    `""`$ Британия  (Britaniya) is the translation of the `& word  Britain   It refers to the island country in northwestern Europe  which comprises England  Wales  and Scotland  and is governed as a unitary state under the name United Kingdom  The term can also be used to specifically refer to England  especially when contrasted with Scotland or Wales ",
