    `!"price",
    `""`$ ставка  (stavka) can be translated as  bet    stake   or  garrison  in `&  In a betting context  it refers to the amount of money or something else that one is willing to wager  In a military context  it means garrison  a body of troops occupying a place  especially a fortified position ",
