    `#"9.4939e-06"
  },
  {
    ` "компьютерной",
    `!"computer",
    `#"9.4918e-06",
    `""The Russian word \"компьютерной\"`(\"computer-related\" or \"computery\" in `&. This term is often used in a more general sense to describe things associated with computers such as software, programming, hardware, etc. Learning how to recognize and use this prefix can help you build your vocabulary in the field of technology."
  },
  {
    ` "упа",
    `!"insurgent, paramilitary, uda, nkvd",
