    `#"9.4857e-06"
  },
  {
    ` "разработаны",
    `!"developed",
    `""`$ разработаны  (pronounced as  razrabotani ) is in the plural form  It translates directly to  have been developed  or  were developed  in `& when used with a past tense verb  So  if you re talking about projects that have been created  improved  or designed over time   разработаны  would be an appropriate choice  The word is made up of the prefix  раз-   meaning  apart    asunder   or  completely ; the root  раб-   meaning  worker  or  laborer ; and the suffix  -ota-   which indicates a process of making  working  or creating something ",
    `#"9.4857e-06"
