  },
  {
    ` "доцент",
    `!"professor, lecturer",
    `""`$ доцент  (dozent) is a title for a university lecturer or assistant professor  It s usually given to someone who holds a doctoral degree and is involved in teaching and research at a higher educational institution  but hasn t yet been promoted to the rank of professor  This term is similar to the `& terms  lecturer  or  assistant professor  ",
