  },
  {
    ` "классу",
    `!"class, classes",
    `""`$ классу  (transliterated as  klassu ) is a dative case form of the noun  класс  (class)  When used in a sentence  it implies something belongs to or is intended for a particular class or group  For example:  Это книга по риторике и для классу старшеклассников `( This book is about rhetoric and is intended for the older students  (dative case) class  ",
