    `!"reputation, credibility, prestige",
    `""`$ авторитет  (authoryet) can be translated to `& as  authority    influence   or  prestige   It refers to a person  group  or institution that is respected and obeyed because of their knowledge  power  or position  In certain contexts  it might also imply expertise in a particular field ",
