  },
  {
    ` "останется",
    `!"will, stays, remain",
    `""`$ останется  (remaining  staying  left) is typically used to express that someone or something will remain in a certain place after others have left  or it can imply that something or someone will continue to exist over time  In `&  this idea can be conveyed with phrases like  will stay    will remain   or  will be left  ",
