    `""`$ дерби  (derbi) is a transliteration of the `& word  derby   which typically refers to a type of shoe or boot with a laced upper and a rounded toe  but can also refer to a hat  However  in a sports context  it s often used in Russia to describe a major football match between local rival teams  similar to the concept of a derby in `& football ",
