  {
    ` "считалась",
    `!"regarded, considered, became",
    `""`$ считалась  (sčitalas ) is a past participle of the verb  считывать  (sčityvat )  which means  to count  to tally  or to read aloud from a written text   When used as a past participle   считалась  implies that something was counted or calculated in the past  For example   Это число считалось  поэтому мы знаем его точно `( This number was counted  so we know it exactly  ",
