    ` "ньютона",
    `!"newton",
    `""ньютона (pronounced  nyutona ) is the Russian translation of the `& term  Newton   It refers to Sir Isaac Newton  a renowned physicist and mathematician who lived in the 17th century and made significant contributions to the fields of calculus  optics  and motion  The unit of force used in physics is also named after him – the Newton (N)  In Russian  it can be either written as  Ньютон  or  ньютон  ",
