  },
  {
    ` "животное",
    `!"animal",
    `""`$ животное  (zhivotnoe) translates directly to  animal  in `&  It is a noun that refers to any non-human  multicellular organism that belongs to the kingdom Animalia  characterized by its ability to move spontaneously with body and sense organs typically arising from or differentiated from a hollow dorsal tube (the notochord  or its descendants  the vertebrate column)  It encompasses a wide variety of creatures such as mammals  birds  reptiles  fish  amphibians  and invertebrates ",
    `#"7.9354e-06"
  },
  {
