    ` "транскрипции",
    `!"transcription",
    `""`$ транскрипции  (transliterated as  transkriptsiya ) refers to the process of transcribing or converting speech sounds from one language into the orthography  or written form  of another language  It s commonly used in linguistics and foreign language education contexts  For example  when learning Russian  you might use transcription to help you pronounce unfamiliar words correctly based on their sound in `& ",
