  },
  {
    ` "бурят",
    `!"mongolian",
    `""`$ Бурят  (Buryat) refers to a people group who primarily reside in Siberia  Russia  and Mongolia  They are a Mongolian ethnic group with their own unique language and culture  The Buryats practice shamanism  Buddhism  or Christianity  often combining these beliefs in unique ways  The Russian term is used to denote either an individual who belongs to the Buryat ethnicity or the larger geographical region inhabited by this ethnic group ",
