    ` "проверка",
    `!"inspection, testing",
    `""`$ проверка  (pronounced as pro-ver -ka)`( check    examination   or  inspection   It is a verb that can be used in various contexts such as checking a piece of work  examining documents  or inspecting a machine  The noun form of the word is  проверка  (prover -ka)  For example  if you need to check your homework  you would say  Проверить домашку  (pro-verit  domashku)  which means  to check your homework  ",
