  {
    ` "центов",
    `!"cents, dollar",
    `""Центов (centov in `&) is a Russian word derived from the Latin word centum  meaning  hundred   In a modern context  it s used to denote a unit of currency equal to one hundred kopeks  However  since Russia abandoned the kopek in 1998  nowadays  cents are no longer an official Russian currency denomination  Instead  you would use rubles (рубль) and their fractional units such as kopecks (копейка)  So  when someone says  centov  today  it may refer to historical or casual usage ",
    `#"7.6324e-06"
