    `!"reservoir, stream, tributary",
    `""`$ водоток  (vodotok)`( watercourse  or  stream  in `&  It refers to a natural or artificial waterway  such as a river  brook  or canal  The term can also be used figuratively to describe the flow of something else  like information or events ",
    `#"7.6242e-06"
  },
  {
    ` "изображена",
    `!"depicts, depicted",
    `""`$ изображена  (izobrazhena) can be translated as  depicted    portrayed   or  shown   It is used to describe a situation where something  such as an image or object  has been represented or shown  For example  if you have taken a picture of a beautiful landscape and someone asks what it looks like  you could say   Это изображено на фото  ( Eto izobrazheno na fotо )  which means   It is depicted in the photo  ",
