    `#"7.616e-06"
  },
  {
    ` "буквами",
    `!"initials",
    `#"7.616e-06",
    `""The Russian word \"буквами\"`(\"in letters (or in alphabet)\" in `&. This term is often used when asking someone to write something out completely in letters or when referring to reading words letter by letter."
  },
  {
    ` "альянса",
    `!"alliance",
