    `""`$ независимое  (nezavisimoe) is an adjective that`( independent  in `&  It s used to describe something or someone that acts freely without any controlling influence  whether it s a country  a person  an organization  or any other entity  For example   независимая страна  (nezavisimaya strana) means  an independent country  ",
