    ` "лавры",
    `!"venerable, monastery",
    `""лавры (lavry) is a Russian noun that`( lavra  in `&  In Christian context  it refers to a large monastery  often with multiple buildings and a self-governing community  that was established before the Schism of 1054 between Eastern Orthodoxy and Roman Catholicism  Lavras are significant historical  cultural  and religious sites in Russia and other Eastern Orthodox countries ",
