    `#"7.6098e-06"
  },
  {
    ` "филологический",
    `!"philology",
    `""`$ филологический  (filolohicheskii) is an adjective derived from the noun  филология  (filologiya)  which`( philology   In a broader context   филологический  refers to anything related to philology or scholarship focused on language and literature  More specifically  it could describe a person who is a philologist or a philological study  such as the study of Greek or Roman literature  or a course in linguistics  It s often associated with academic pursuits involving languages  literatures  and cultural studies ",
    `#"7.6098e-06"
  },
  {
