  {
    ` "сл",
    `!"arr, tune, hymn",
    `""`$ сл  (sl) does not have a direct translation in `&  It is a conjunction used to connect two clauses in a sentence  typically indicating that the second clause provides an explanation or gives more information about the first one  For example   Я иду по дому  сл я ищу ключи  (I m walking at home  because I m looking for keys)  In this sentence   сл  connects the two clauses and suggests that the action of searching for keys is the reason for walking around the house ",
