    `"" In Russian  the word  уж  (pronounced as  uzh ) is a small particle used to indicate a certain degree of emphasis or impatience in speech  It can be translated roughly as  well    so   or  anyway  in `&  depending on the context it s used in  For example   Я пошла домой уж   (Ya poshla domoy uzh ) means  I went home anyway    It is important to note that  уж  does not have a direct one-to-one translation in `& and its usage often depends on the context and tone of voice ",
