    `!"capitol",
    `""`$ Капитолий  (Kapitol  in transliteration) is the translation of the Latin word  Capitolium   and it refers to a building or complex housing a legislative assembly  such as the U S  Capitol Building in Washington  D C  In Russia  there are two buildings called the  Капитолий  (Kapitol ): one is located in Moscow and serves as the seat of the Russian Federal Assembly  and the other is situated in St  Petersburg and houses the legislative branch of the city government ",
