    `""`$ законодательное  (zakonodatel noye) is an adjective derived from the noun  законы  (zakony  meaning  laws )  Therefore   законодательное  refers to something related to laws or lawmaking  It can be used to describe a legislative body  such as a parliament  or legislative actions or processes  For example   Законодательное собрание `( Parliament  in `& ",
