    `""`$ долей  (doley) is a noun that can be translated as  share    portion   or  part   It is often used in contexts related to distribution  allocation  or division  For example  if you have a pie and want to share it with your friends  you might say   I will divide the pie into equal shares (доли) for everyone  ",
