    `!"crosby",
    `#"6.8829e-06",
    `""The Russian word \"Кросби\" doesn't have a direct translation in `& as it is a surname, specifically belonging to the famous American musician Eric Clapton whose name transliterated from `& to Cyrillic is Кросби Эрик (Krosbi Erik). If you are trying to learn Russian and come across names, remember that they don't have direct translations like words do. Instead, focus on pronunciation and spelling."
  },
  {
