    ` "половых",
    `!"sexual, genital",
    `#"6.8747e-06",
    `""The Russian word \"половых\" is not commonly used in everyday speech or written language. However, if we break it down, \"половые\" (masculine plural) and \"половая\" (feminine singular) are related to sexual or gender matters, as in \"sexual\" or \"gender.\" But please note that this is not a standard term used for such topics in Russian. A more appropriate and common term would be \"сексуальные\" or \"гендерные\" for masculine plural, and \"сексуальная\" or \"гендерная\" for feminine singular."
  },
  {
