  },
  {
    ` "понимают",
    `!"confused, understood, understand, understands",
    `""`$ понимают  (ponimayut)`( understand  in `&  It s a reflexive verb  which means that it implies the subject of the sentence is both the one doing the understanding and the one being understood  For example   Она понимает этот язык   (She understands this language ) In this case  she is both understanding the language and being understood by the language ",
    `#"6.8726e-06"
  },
  {
    ` "пробуждение",
    `!"awakening",
    `""`$ пробуждение  (pronounced probuzhdenie) can be translated into `& as  awakening  or  enlightenment   It is commonly used to describe a sudden realization  awareness  or awakening to something  often with a focus on spiritual or philosophical enlightenment  In a broader sense  it can also refer to the awakening or rebirth of a nation or people ",
    `#"6.8726e-06"
  },
  {
    ` "специализированные",
    `!"specialized",
