  },
  {
    ` "дополнительной",
    `!"additional",
    `""`$ дополнительной  (dopolnitel noi) is a feminine form of an adjective that can be roughly translated to  additional    supplementary   or  extra   It is used to describe something that is extra  additional  or supplementary  For example   дополнительной шкафчик  means  an additional cabinet  ",
