    `!"nuclei",
    `""`$ ядер  (yadery)`( nuclear  in `&  It is primarily used in the context of nuclear energy  weapons  or anything related to nuclear technology  For example   Атомная электростанция  (Atomnaya elektroustaniya) means  nuclear power station  ",
