    `!"louvre",
    `""`$ эрмитаж  (Ermitaž) is most commonly known as The Hermitage Museum  It s a famous art and cultural museum complex in Saint Petersburg  Russia  It was founded in 1764 by Catherine the Great and has grown to house over three million items  including works from Leonardo da Vinci  Michelangelo  Rembrandt  and many other renowned artists  The original palace  known as the Winter Palace  forms one part of the museum  and is situated on the Neva River  The Hermitage Museum complex includes several buildings  including the General Staff Building  which houses the museum s collection of Western European art  and the Menshikov Palace  It s considered one of the largest and most important museums in the world ",
