    `!"commercial",
    `#"5.9408e-06",
    `""In `&, the Russian word \"коммерческая\"`(\"commercial.\" It's often used to describe something related to commerce or business activities. For example, a \"коммерческий центр\" is a commercial center or mall in `&."
