    `""`$ кунья  (kun ya) is a female diminutive form derived from a woman s surname or family name  It is often used informally  among friends and family  to show affection or familiarity  In `&  it can be roughly translated as  little cat  due to the etymology of many Russian surnames being derived from animals  but when used in this context  it doesn t carry that meaning ",
